    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to bring number 14 Westmill Green, Millers Glen, Swords to the open market for sale. Boasting an impressive A2 BER rating, this beautifully presented 3 bed, 3 bath detached home, extending to approximately 116m2, enjoys a prime position at the front of the development. Featuring an attractive double fronted design, south facing rear garden and off-street parking for two cars, the property offers a fantastic combination of energy efficiency, generous accommodation and an enviable setting. \n\nUpon entering, you`re welcomed by a bright and inviting hallway, with the accommodation thoughtfully arranged on either side. The double fronted design allows plenty of natural light into the home, creating a bright and comfortable atmosphere throughout. To the left, you`ll find a generous kitchen/dining area, creating a sociable heart of the home with direct access to the rear garden. The kitchen is complemented by a spacious utility room, providing valuable additional storage and practical space for everyday living. The dining area is well suited to both family meals and entertaining. To the right of the entrance is a cosy and welcoming living room, providing a comfortable space to unwind away from the main living area. A convenient guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, the property offers three well-proportioned bedrooms. The main bedroom benefits from its own private en-suite, while bedrooms two and three are both generously sized doubles, offering excellent space for family, guests or those working from home. A well-appointed family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\n\nExternally, the south facing rear garden is a particularly appealing feature, offering a sunny and private space to relax, entertain or enjoy outdoor dining. To the front, the property enjoys an attractive open outlook over green space and a playground, while the generous front garden and off-street parking for two cars add further practicality.\n\nMillers Glen is ideally positioned, offering excellent access to Swords Village, the M1, M50 and Dublin Airport, making it a convenient location for commuters and families alike. The development has recently benefited from the introduction of a row of shops directly to the front, while Swords Village is also within easy reach, offering an excellent choice of shops, cafés, bars and restaurants. The Pavilions Shopping Centre and Airside Retail Park are close by, providing a wide range of shopping, dining and leisure facilities. The area is well served by public transport, including regular bus services and the Swords Express, with convenient connections to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. A range of national and secondary schools, as well as numerous sporting and recreational facilities, are also located nearby, making Millers Glen a well-established and convenient setting for a variety of buyers.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 2.58m (8'6\") x 2.42m (7'11\")\n-With laminate wood floor\n-Guest WC\n\nGuest W.C. - 1.53m (5'0\") x 1.67m (5'6\")\n-With tiled floor\n-WC and WHB\n-Heated towel rail\n\n\nKitchen/Diner - 6.22m (20'5\") x 6.65m (21'10\")\n-With laminate wood floor\n-With a range of matching floor and eye level fitted press units\n-Integrated appliances\n-Filtered water system\n-French doors to rear garden\n-Utility Room\n\nUtility Room - 2.19m (7'2\") x 2.43m (8'0\")\n-With laminate wood floor\n-Plumbed for washing machine and tumble dryer\n\n\nLounge - 3.72m (12'2\") x 5.67m (18'7\")\n-With laminate wood floor\n-Storage\n\nFirst Floor Landing\n-With carpet\n-Hotpress \n-Access to attic via Stire.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.49m (11'5\") x 4.1m (13'5\")\n-With carpet \n-Built in wardrobe\n-En-Suite\n\nEn-Suite - 2.31m (7'7\") x 1.47m (4'10\")\n-With tiled floor & partially tiled walls\n-WC and WHB\n-Shower cubicle\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.68m (8'10\") x 4.16m (13'8\")\n-With carpet \n-Storage\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.25m (10'8\") x 2.21m (7'3\")\n-With carpet \n-Built in wardrobe\n\nBathroom - 2.66m (8'9\") x 1.75m (5'9\")\n-With tiled floor & partially tiled walls\n-WC and WHB\n-Panel bath with shower attachment\n-Heated towel rail\n\n"
